Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}*Sigh*{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Weren't you keeping watch inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Satoko got mad at me for peeking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's amazing for standing up to Shinpei-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Satoko, what can I do to make you like me more?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Showing off your swordsmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...just makes her scared of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, then maybe you should start by \Nmaking her feel secure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nikaido-sama, please pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My, it's getting noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamamoto-san, from now on, no matter if you hear gunshots or screams from this room...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...absolutely do not come in to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Safe and sound.
